# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ARC environment
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# ARC is local-first and server-less (docs/decisions.md, 2026-07-24): there is
# no backend and no server-side secrets. The only credential the app needs is
# the AI provider key, and that does NOT live here — it is entered in Settings
# and stored in the iOS Keychain (expo-secure-store), never in the bundle
# (Phase 3). So this file is intentionally almost empty.
#
# IMPORTANT: anything prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the JS bundle at
# build time and is readable by anyone who has the app. Only ever put values
# here that are safe to ship publicly.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- App -------------------------------------------------------------------
EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=development
